  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust Fund (LSETF)- Intermarc Bank Agent Skills Training</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Intermarc Consulting Limited is proposing to deliver agent banking training for 160 unemployed Lagos state residents who will therefore be provided employment as agents with Access Bank Plc after which they will be empowered to be small scale agents signed up by the bank to support the deployment of anchor products for financial inclusion rollout. The company plans to equip all the beneficiaries with human centered design skills and approach to product development.</narrative>
  </description>
